{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは、渡辺です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/12/26/5213913/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスっていう季節はとても好きで\n街並みや、人々の雰囲気\nイルミネーションや音楽が素敵です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスイブには美味しいご飯を食べ、\nクリスマスには絢音とクリスマスソング\nをかけてひたすら歌うという事を\nしていました(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様はどんなクリスマスでしたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/12/26/5213913/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/12/26/5213913/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織に撮ってもらった写真\nありがとう、伊織〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはよくあるじゃないですか、\n泡をひげみたいに可愛くつけるやつ。\nあれをどうしてもやりたくて渡辺さん\nやってみようと試みたところ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まったく可愛くなりませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織にも微妙な顔されてしまいました、、\nまた今度挑戦してみよう(めげないぞ渡辺)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/12/26/5213913/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どーーーーーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎みりターン◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねしもんさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・2016年もまもなく終わりだけど、\n何かやり残した事はある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→学校の課題です...(ダレカタスケテ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ユウセイ@１月京都さん、りょっちさん\n（同じ質問でした）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・年が終わる瞬間何をする予定？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→真夏軍団で自撮り動画を撮りあって\n送り合う予定(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はっぴーにゅーいやああああ\nうおああああああみたいな。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けいくんさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・長野一人で暇すぎて何かいい暇潰しの方法はないですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→やはり滝行しかないんじゃないかな\nって思いますよ（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今の季節ならなんとお得な極寒付き（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"賢さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・新年一発目にやりたいことは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→旅行に行きたい〜(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひかりのさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・みり愛が最近、幸せだなぁって感じた事は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→生誕祭とか、握手会、ライブ\nは本当に幸せ、有難いと感じます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、にゃんの生誕祭で\nお手紙を読まさせていただきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃんは1期生2期生関係なく\nいろいろな話が出来る大切な存在だし\n真剣な話もそうだけど\n時にはふざけたりうえええいしたり、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、ご飯行こうね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃんおめでとうううううううう\nうええええええええい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生誕委員の皆様、お邪魔しました！\n素敵な生誕祭でした。\nいきなり何語か分からない登場曲が\n流れたり、かなり面白かったです。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/12/26/5213913/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また見てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"}